@startuml
title Payment lifecycle represented by PaymentsServiceBL
[*] --> Pending
Pending --> Scheduled : scheduleRecurringPayment
Pending --> Completed : processPayment
Scheduled --> Cancelled : cancelPayment
Completed --> Refunded : refundPayment
Cancelled --> [*]
Refunded --> [*]
note right of Pending
  Other transitions are rejected by the service.
  Repeated cancellation, processing, scheduling,
  or refund attempts do not persist a state change.
end note
@enduml
